#ASSERT `How many weeks of benefits does the table for Pilot Project No. 6 give me` 420 13.5 EQUALS JUST 31
-- 419 hours is below the first row of the table: the table does not answer.
#ASSERT `How many weeks of benefits does the table for Pilot Project No. 6 give me` 419 13.5 EQUALS NOTHING

