§ `B7: How many weeks of benefits does the table for Pilot Project No. 6 give me (Schedule II.2)?`

-- At 6% exactly the rate is in the lowest band; row 700 - 734 gives 19 weeks there (Schedule II.2).
#ASSERT `How many weeks of benefits does the table for Pilot Project No. 6 give me` 700 6 EQUALS JUST 19
-- Just above 6% the rate is in the second band: 21 weeks.
